or 快速生成新技能的标准流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    NEED[&quot;Identify Need&quot;] --&gt; SCOPE{&quot;Select Scope&quot;}&#10;    SCOPE --&gt;|&quot;Global&quot;| GLOBAL[&quot;~/.trae-cn/skills/&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt;|&quot;Project&quot;| PROJECT[&quot;.trae/skills/&quot;]&#10;    GLOBAL --&gt; CREATE[&quot;Create SKILL.md&quot;]&#10;    PROJECT --&gt; CREATE&#10;    CREATE --&gt; TEST[&quot;Test Skill&quot;]&#10;    TEST --&gt; ITERATE[&quot;Iterate &amp; Optimize&quot;]&#10;    ITERATE --&gt; PUBLISH[&quot;Share / Publish&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    NEED[\"Identify Need\"] --&gt; SCOPE{\"Select Scope\"}\n    SCOPE --&gt;|\"Global\"| GLOBAL[\"~/.trae-cn/skills/\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt;|\"Project\"| PROJECT[\".trae/skills/\"]\n    GLOBAL --&gt; CREATE[\"Create SKILL.md\"]\n    PROJECT --&gt; CREATE\n    CREATE --&gt; TEST[\"Test Skill\"]\n    TEST --&gt; ITERATE[\"Iterate &amp; Optimize\"]\n    ITERATE --&gt; PUBLISH[\"Share / Publish\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建项目级技能&#10;mkdir -p .trae/skills/my-skill&#10;touch .trae/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md&#10;&#10;# 创建全局级技能&#10;mkdir -p ~/.trae-cn/skills/my-skill&#10;touch ~/.trae-cn/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建项目级技能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .trae/skills/my-skill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">touch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .trae/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span clas